== Walkthrough ==

During the [[Drolvarg Teeth]] quest, Captain Nealith mentions his siblings...

You say, 'What about your sibling?'

: Captain Nealith appears saddened by the mention of his sibling. 'My brother Marltek has been missing for quite some time. I found coarse Drolvarg hair inside his tent which leads me to believe he has become a meal for the dogs. CURSE THE EVIL DOGS!! I shall see them all dead!!'

'''At +1510, -1395, there are two tents with a fixed spawn of three drolvargs.  Keep clearing these drolvargs until [[a drolvarg scavenger]] spawns.'''

: a drolvarg scavenger begins to howl and yip. 'Grrr.. Mad..ness!! Red, sweet red.' 

'''Kill it.'''

a drolvarg scavenger's corpse yips and falls to the ground. A tattered note appears to be tucked into his armor. 

Loot a [[Bloodsoaked Note]], which reads:

 Dear, brother, I fear that my soul has been overtaken by a great evil. My sanity barely hangs on by a thread.
 My dreams of the sweet red blood of others are soon to drive me mad.  The howls in the night call to me.
 It is best for me to leave.  I pray that I can deliver this note before I go mad.
 Please understand that it is better that I am never seen again.
 Goodbye.  Keep up the fight for the forest folk.

: Two things to be aware of, #1 The scavenger at this camp doesn't drop the note every time. #2 The wandering scavengers never drop it. 

'''Give the note to Captain Nealith.'''

: Captain Nealith nearly faints after reading the letter. 'Dear Marltek!! I shall miss you. There is more evil in this land!! Madness beyond description. Thank you ______. You put my soul at ease and give me new direction. Please accept my brothers blade. He found it in the wilds. May you use it to slay many Drolvarg!!'

